4":{"id":"pa445dda3b3e0-item-0cd4b8aa23b013f92804","person_id":"pa445dda3b3e0","title":"青玉案","units":[{"id":"pa445dda3b3e0-item-0cd4b8aa23b013f92804-part-01","status":"automatic","work_id":"pa445dda3b3e0-text-a06a50226e0566e083a3","title":"青玉案"}]},"pa445dda3b3e0-item-e9acbf8e418d72128af8":{"id":"pa445dda3b3e0-item-e9acbf8e418d72128af8","person_id":"pa445dda3b3e0","title":"","units":[]},"pa445dda3b3e0-item-266710f494e16fe838af":{"id":"pa445dda3b3e0-item-266710f494e16fe838af","person_id":"pa445dda3b3e0","title":"","units":[]},"pa445dda3b3e0-item-4a955a8620753fa2ebb9":{"id":"pa445dda3b3e0-item-4a955a8620753fa2ebb9","person_id":"pa445dda3b3e0","title":"","units":[]},"pa445dda3b3e0-item-6510cb9320963e9558fa":{"id":"pa445dda3b3e0-item-6510cb9320963e9558fa","person_id":"pa445dda3b3e0","title":"留別","units":[{"id":"pa445dda3b3e0-item-6510cb9320963e9558fa-part-01","status":"automatic","work_id":"pa445dda3b3e0-text-2cee869f2c898dcbea4c","title":"留別"}]}},"works":{"pa445dda3b3e0-text-0937d0aeb5d5b97db927":{"id":"pa445dda3b3e0-text-0937d0aeb5d5b97db927","person_id":"pa445dda3b3e0","title":"題哥羅驛竹枝詞","titles":["題哥羅驛竹枝詞"],"text":"尺五攀天天慘顔，鹽煙溪瘴鎖諸蠻。\n平生夢亦未嘗處，聞有鴉飛不到山。\n風黑馬嘶馿瘦嶺，日黄人度鬼門關。\n黔南此去無多遠，想在夕陽猿嘯間。"},"pa445dda3b3e0-text-a06a50226e0566e083a3":{"id":"pa445dda3b3e0-text-a06a50226e0566e083a3","person_id":"pa445dda3b3e0","title":"青玉案","titles":["青玉案"],"text":"行人欲上来时路。\n破晓雾、轻寒去。\n隔叶子规声暗度。\n十分酒满，舞裀歌袖，沾夜无寻处。\n故人近送旌旗暮。\n但听阳关第三句。\n欲断离肠馀几许。\n满天星月，看人憔悴，烛泪垂如雨。"},"pa445dda3b3e0-text-2cee869f2c898dcbea4c":{"id":"pa445dda3b3e0-text-2cee869f2c898dcbea4c","person_id":"pa445dda3b3e0","title":"留別","titles":["留別"],"text":"桄榔笋白映玉箸，椰子酒清宜具觴。\n市井衣裘半夷夏，陰晴朝暮變炎凉。\n莫推月色共千里，不寄江南書一行。\n無頼笳聲上雲漢，曉來偏繞九回腸。"}}}
